Every fact whose line citations changed (about 30) has a recorded remap in the A1, A2 or E citation lists. I spot-checked about 25 cited lines at HEAD and all hold. The post-fix citecheck's 'drifted' flags in this scope are false alarms. Tests after the rebuild pass: the zoom test 783 passed and 0 failed, mltest-after all PASS, and crawl errors.json is empty.

