- the mesh-stop crossing now shows the link-bit drawing, repeater half included;
- the minion's ET-Link part offers the bank FIFOs twice ('Zoom in' and 'Also');
- the UC scale still lists shire.composition's 'fast credit counters', which is the vendor's Minion Overview slide (UC block: 'ET Fast Credit Counter') and not a contradiction;
